<figure class="grok-budget-diagram" aria-labelledby="grok-budget-caption">
  <svg
    class="grok-budget-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 600"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="grok-budget-title grok-budget-desc"
  >
    <title id="grok-budget-title">模型執行前的事件與預算閘門</title>
    <desc id="grok-budget-desc"
      >事件先經過來源驗證與去重，再原子檢查並預留預算，通過後才喚醒
      worker。每次執行結果與費用回到同一份任務紀錄。這是本文建議自行實作的接收層，不是
      Grok Bot 內建功能。</desc
    >
    <defs
      ><marker
        id="grok-budget-arrow"
        markerWidth="8"
        markerHeight="8"
        refX="6"
        refY="4"
        orient="auto"><path d="M 0 0 L 8 4 L 0 8 Z"></path></marker
      ></defs
    >
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__banner"
      x="20"
      y="20"
      width="920"
      height="64"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__heading" x="44" y="49"
      >把閘門放在喚醒之前</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__detail" x="44" y="71"
      >本文建議的自建接收層：主 Bot 週額度與外部費用分開記錄</text
    >
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="108"
      width="920"
      height="104"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__number" x="44" y="146">01</text>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__heading" x="102" y="143">接收與去重</text>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="102" y="172"
      >驗證來源、事件種類與穩定 ID；重複事件查原任務</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__detail" x="102" y="187"
      >沒有有效新變化 → 不派工；保留來源 cursor，避免漏接</text
    >
    <path class="grok-budget-diagram__arrow" d="M 480 217 V 239"></path>
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="250"
      width="920"
      height="104"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__number" x="44" y="288">02</text>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__heading" x="102" y="285"
      >檢查並預留預算</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="102" y="314"
      >已結算 + 執行中預留 + 新工作上界 ≤ 預算，且併發未滿</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__detail" x="102" y="329"
      >同一原子操作完成檢查與預留；不通過 → 等待或回報</text
    >
    <path class="grok-budget-diagram__arrow" d="M 480 359 V 381"></path>
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="392"
      width="920"
      height="104"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__number" x="44" y="430">03</text>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__heading" x="102" y="427"
      >執行、驗收與對帳</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="102" y="456"
      >固定輸入版本與驗收條件；記錄 artifact、結果、費用與未完成項</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__detail" x="102" y="471"
      >結算後釋放預留；通知失敗不重做已完成的工作</text
    >
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__banner"
      x="20"
      y="524"
      width="920"
      height="56"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__lead" x="44" y="553"
      >HTTP 200 只證明接受；安靜沒有回覆，也不等於沒有執行成本。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <svg
    class="grok-budget-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 280 700"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="grok-budget-mobile-title grok-budget-mobile-desc"
  >
    <title id="grok-budget-mobile-title">喚醒前的閘門</title>
    <desc id="grok-budget-mobile-desc"
      >桌面圖的直向窄螢幕排列。自建接收層先去重，再預留預算，最後執行驗收並對帳。</desc
    >
    <defs
      ><marker
        id="grok-budget-arrow-mobile"
        markerWidth="8"
        markerHeight="8"
        refX="6"
        refY="4"
        orient="auto"><path d="M 0 0 L 8 4 L 0 8 Z"></path></marker
      ></defs
    >
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__banner"
      x="2"
      y="2"
      width="276"
      height="96"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__heading" x="18" y="31"
      >把閘門放在喚醒之前</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="55"
      >本文建議的自建接收層</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__detail" x="18" y="73"
      >非 Grok Bot 內建設定</text
    >
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__card"
      x="2"
      y="118"
      width="276"
      height="138"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__heading" x="18" y="149"
      >01　接收與去重</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="178"
      >驗證來源、種類與穩定 ID</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="202"
      >重複事件查原任務，不再派工</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__detail" x="18" y="230"
      >保留 cursor 與漏接核對機制</text
    >
    <path class="grok-budget-diagram__arrow-mobile" d="M 140 263 V 281"></path>
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__card"
      x="2"
      y="292"
      width="276"
      height="138"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__heading" x="18" y="323"
      >02　檢查並預留預算</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="352"
      >已結算 + 執行中預留</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="376"
      >+ 新工作上界 ≤ 預算</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__detail" x="18" y="404"
      >原子預留；另檢查併發上限</text
    >
    <path class="grok-budget-diagram__arrow-mobile" d="M 140 437 V 455"></path>
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__card"
      x="2"
      y="466"
      width="276"
      height="138"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__heading" x="18" y="497"
      >03　執行、驗收與對帳</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="526"
      >固定輸入版本與驗收條件</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="550"
      >保存證據、費用與未完成項</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__detail" x="18" y="578"
      >結算後釋放預留</text
    >
    <rect
      class="grok-budget-diagram__banner"
      x="2"
      y="622"
      width="276"
      height="76"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="647"
      >HTTP 200 不代表完成。</text
    >
    <text class="grok-budget-diagram__body" x="18" y="669"
      >沒有回覆，不等於沒有成本。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <figcaption id="grok-budget-caption">
    工程建議：在模型執行前去重與預留預算，執行後以任務識別碼連回驗收與費用。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .grok-budget-diagram {
    margin: var(--space-8) 0;
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__mobile {
    display: none !important;
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__banner {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__heading {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__number {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__body {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__detail {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__lead {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__arrow,
  .grok-budget-diagram__arrow-mobile {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__arrow {
    marker-end: url(#grok-budget-arrow);
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram__arrow-mobile {
    marker-end: url(#grok-budget-arrow-mobile);
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram marker path {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }
  .grok-budget-diagram figcaption {
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .grok-budget-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .grok-budget-diagram__mobile {
      display: block !important;
    }
  }
</style>
